{"about_the_game":"<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >JAMES BOND HAS GADGETS, YOU HAVE TOOLS AND CREATIVITY</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3102370/extras/c5f8017e97f22df3c80ef4acfeb9577c.poster.avif?t=1763564756\" width=1170 height=292 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3102370/extras/c5f8017e97f22df3c80ef4acfeb9577c.webm?t=1763564756\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3102370/extras/c5f8017e97f22df3c80ef4acfeb9577c.mp4?t=1763564756\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\ud83d\udd27 SOLVE WITH YOUR HANDS</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Built for VR from the ground up, FIXER UNDERCOVER turns the prison into your puzzle playground. Grip a power drill and bypass  locks. Use an angle grinder to cut through &quot;faulty&quot; vents. With realistic tool physics and haptic feedback, you'll feel every screw turn, every wire snap, every mechanism click into place.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The prison is one massive environmental puzzle. Observe. Improvise. Combine. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\ud83e\udd16 MEET WINSTON</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >You're not alone. Winston  is your drone partner\u2014your hacker, your scout, your intel source.  Keep him calm, leverage his skills, and when the pressure's on, he'll come through. Probably.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><picture><source srcset=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3102370/extras/72d0b2e161ce8b6c3bfdced9e37950f4.webp?t=1763564756\"><img src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3102370/extras/72d0b2e161ce8b6c3bfdced9e37950f4.poster.webp?t=1763564756\" class=\"bb_img\" width=500 height=150 /></picture></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\ud83d\udd12 THE SETUP</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Redemption Prison is a lie. Warden Kozlov's celebrated &quot;Born Again&quot; program turns hardened criminals into model citizens\u2014or so the world believes. The Agency knows better. Behind the miracle is a conspiracy funded by millions in shadow money.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >That's where you come in.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\ud83d\udc64 YOUR COVER</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >You're The Fixer\u2014a ghost operative hiding in plain sight as a maintenance worker. Your toolbox is your arsenal. Your cover is perfect. Nobody notices the handyman with a wrench. They think you're here to repair pipes. You're here to dismantle their entire operation.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\ud83c\udfaf YOUR MISSION</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Infiltrate. Impovise. Expose. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><picture><source srcset=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3102370/extras/d4fcc199d3fbebca679df774030f7e26.webp?t=1763564756\"><img src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3102370/extras/d4fcc199d3fbebca679df774030f7e26.poster.webp?t=1763564756\" class=\"bb_img\" width=500 height=150 /></picture></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\ud83c\udfaf YOUR MISSION Infiltrate. Impovise. Expose.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>From former escape room designers who understand that the best puzzles make you feel like a genius when you solve them.</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p>","background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3102370?t=1763564756","background_raw":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3102370?t=1763564756","capsule_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_ass