 is your drone partner\u2014your hacker, your scout, your intel source.  Keep him calm, leverage his skills, and when the pressure's on, he'll come through. Probably.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><picture><source srcset=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3102370/extras/72d0b2e161ce8b6c3bfdced9e37950f4.webp?t=1763564756\"><img src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3102370/extras/72d0b2e161ce8b6c3bfdced9e37950f4.poster.webp?t=1763564756\" class=\"bb_img\" width=500 height=150 /></picture></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\ud83d\udd12 THE SETUP</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Redemption Prison is a lie. Warden Kozlov's celebrated &quot;Born Again&quot; program turns hardened criminals into model citizens\u2014or so the world believes. The Agency knows better. Behind the miracle is a conspiracy funded by millions in shadow money.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >That's where you come in.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\ud83d\udc64 YOUR COVER</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >You're The Fixer\u2014a ghost operative hiding in plain sight as a maintenance worker. Your toolbox is your arsenal. Your cover is perfect. Nobody notices the handyman with a wrench. They think you're here to repair pipes. You're here to dismantle their entire operation.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\ud83c\udfaf YOUR MISSION</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Infiltrate. Impovise. Expose. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><picture><source srcset=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3102370/extras/d4fcc199d3fbebca679df774030f7e26.webp?t=1763564756\"><img src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3102370/extras/d4fcc199d3fbebca679df774030f7e26.poster.webp?t=1763564756\" class=\"bb_img\" width=500 height=150 /></picture></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\ud83c\udfaf YOUR MISSION Infiltrate. Impovise. Expose.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>From former escape room designers who understand that the best puzzles make you feel like a genius when you solve them.</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p>","developers":["Creativity AR"],"genres":[{"description":"Adventure","id":"25"},{"description":"Casual","id":"4"},{"description":"Indie","id":"23"},{"description":"Simulation","id":"28"}],"header_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3102370/3bed5a940447fe14fda2511507baceea850f113d/header.jpg?t=1763564756","is_free":false,"linux_requirements":{"minimum":"<strong>Minimum:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"></ul>","recommended":"<strong>Recommended:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"></ul>"},"mac_requirements":{"minimum":"<strong>Minimum:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"></ul>","recommended":"<strong>Recommended:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"></ul>"},"movies":[{"dash_av1":"https://video.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_trailers/3102370/859843466/302f39393aaa23622243438e5913b71a777dbc95/1763561432/dash_av1.mpd?t=1763564753","dash_h264":"https://video.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_trailers/3102370/859843466/302f39393aaa23622243438e5913b71a777dbc95/1763561432/dash_h264.mpd?t=1763564753","highlight":true,"hls_h264":"https://video.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_trailers/3102370/859843466/302f39393aaa23622243438e5913b71a777dbc95/1763561432/hls_264_master.m3u8?t=1763564753","id":257234491,"name":"NewShowcase","thumbnail":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/257234491/a2f85752f444883602869ca82d72519b357151bc/movie_600x337.jpg?t=1763564753"},{"dash_av1":"https://video.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_trailers/3102370/704716508/37394b245a210bc15314d2d31c3188920297fd66/1753363539/dash_av1.mpd?t=1763564754","dash_h264":"https://video.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_trailers/3102370/704716508/37394b245a210bc15314d2d31c3188920297fd66/175336