s Bond has gadgets. You have tools and creativity.","steam_appid":3102370,"support_info":{"email":"pkoncewicz@creativityar.com","url":"creativityar.com"},"supported_languages":"English<strong>*</strong><br><strong>*</strong>languages with full audio support","type":"game","website":"https://fixerundercover.com/"}